// later.sg - What later steps of the port fill in: color reduction and dithering (quantize.c,
// kcolor.c), lossy compression (gifwrite.c), the optimizer (optimize.c,
// opttemplate.c) and unoptimizing (gifunopt.c). Each stands here with its signature, so that the
// rest is compiled and tested as it is written; none is called by the tests of this step.
